 ## Command line
 
+`lend cancel-hold CARD TITLE` drops a member's hold and prints
+`hold on TITLE for CARD cancelled`. A copy already set aside for them goes to
+the next member waiting, or back on the shelf.
+
 | key | value | meaning |
 |---|---|---|
 | `--library` | `.` | the library directory (CLI) |
